":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_031851173419ca0c016a9b598ff29487d094cccc6e7f1a2b21","seq":7349,"timestamp":"1788565925Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"编译已转绿，证实问题是第三方 API 假设而非架构缺陷。下一步把测试从已删除的 `/api/v1/hcp` POST 真正迁移到 JDK WebSocket，并统一 REST 临时投影与 HCP 临时帧的事件 JSON 映射，避免两个 Client 入口对 message/tool/permission 字段产生漂移。发送队列保持每连接 256 帧/4 MiB 有界，慢消费者关闭而非无界积压。","startedSeq":7242,"endedSeq":7349,"startedAt":"1788565925Z","endedAt":"1788565927Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":6167,"revision":7349,"observedAt":"1788565927Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788565927Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788565927,"revision":7349,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_031851173419ca0c016a9b598ff29487d094cccc6e7f1a2b21","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-7350","seq":7350,"timestamp":"1788565927Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":7350,"endedSeq":7542,"startedAt":"1788565927Z","endedAt":"1788566164Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":7350,"activityEndSeq":7542,"totalEventCount":27,"toolCallCount":22,"thoughtCount":5,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":1,"writtenFileCount":4,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_098db991a859a057016a9b5a8d3dc887d0a9be6f7103f89a06","seq":7653,"timestamp":"1788566164Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"失败定位到测试消费顺序而非传输丢帧：Run 启动后临时事件可先于 command ack 到达，`nextMatching(CommandAck)` 把这些合法的先到帧丢弃，后续断言才超时。这正是异步 HCP 不应假定跨类别响应全局顺序的场景。我会让测试监听器保留全部已接收帧并按谓词等待，固定“每类帧内部有序、不同帧类型可交错”的协议事实。","startedSeq":7543,"endedSeq":7653,"startedAt":"1788566164Z","endedAt":"1788566166Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":6406,"revision":7653,"observedAt":"1788566166Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788566166Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788566166,"revision":7653,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_098db991a859a057016a9b5a8d3dc887d0a9be6f7103f89a06","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-7654","seq":7654,"timestamp":"1788566166Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":7654,"endedSeq":7738,"startedAt":"1788566166Z","endedAt":"1788566255Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":7654,"activityEndSeq":7738,"totalEventCount":13,"toolCallCount":10,"thoughtCount":3,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":1,"writtenFileCount":1,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_024bd3ee32cf1b39016a9b5aeb9b0487d0b5011af01f96b6fd","seq":7870,"timestamp":"1788566255Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"真实 WebSocket 契约现已通过：未认证连接以 1008 拒绝；认证 cookie 可跨 `/hcp/v1`；二进制 hello/welcome、command ack、snapshot/replay 与详细 transient message 帧均通过。接下来切换 React 的实时路径：Host 元数据提供唯一 WebSocket locator，前端使用生成的 HCP TypeScript codec，先 hello 再 replay，并将 transient/durable/snapshot 投影交给现有 Zustand/Query 状态边界；删除 REST `/events` 轮询消费，避免并行事实源。验证将包含 TypeScript 单测和生产构建。","startedSeq":7739,"endedSeq":7870,"startedAt":"1788566255Z","endedAt":"1788566257Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":6497,"revision":7870,"observedAt":"1788566257Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788566257Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788566257,"revision":7870,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_024bd3ee32cf1b39016a9b5aeb9b0487d0b5011af01f96b6fd","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-7873","seq":7873,"timestamp":"1788566262Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":7873,"endedSeq":8157,"startedAt":"1788566262Z","endedAt":"1788566499Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":7873,"activityEndSeq":8157,"totalEventCount":49,"toolCallCount":42,"thoughtCount":7,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":13,"writtenFileCount":6,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_05d2387aa5034e00016a9b5bdbd78887d0ba6fc9660c68bac8","seq":8309,"timestamp":"1788566499Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"前端生产构建与现有 3 个 UI 单测通过，生成 codec 已进入实际 bundle。现在收紧单一实时入口：REST `/events` 路由虽然前端不再消费，但 Host 仍为每个访问过的 Session 永久维护订阅缓冲，这会留下第二套临时序列和生命周期泄漏。按已批准的“替换旧设计即删除旧入口”规则，我将删除该路由、EventBuffer 与 `lastStreamSeq` REST 事实；快照只携带 durable event watermark，HCP 每连接拥有自己的 transient epoch/sequence。随后增加前端 codec/重放单测，确保这次迁移不是仅靠构建覆盖。","startedSeq":8158,"endedSeq":8309,"startedAt":"1788566499Z","endedAt":"1788566501Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":6741,"revision":8309,"observedAt":"1788566501Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788566501Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788566501,"revision":8309,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_05d2387aa5034e00016a9b5bdbd78887d0ba6fc9660c68bac8","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-8313","seq":8313,"timestamp":"1788566507Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":8313,"endedSeq":8538,"startedAt":"1788566507Z","endedAt":"1788566736Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":8313,"activityEndSeq":8538,"totalEventCount":30,"toolCallCount":28,"thoughtCount":2,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":2,"writtenFileCount":6,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0b4cfb4bc1318cfc016a9b5ccb563887d0833cc95b91e6f1b9","seq":8598,"timestamp":"1788566736Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"删除入口后的响应由现有统一错误目录映射为 `protocol.invalid_message` / HTTP 400，而不是通用 404；这是当前 REST 契约的既有行为。测试应验证入口不可用及结构化错误码，不另行改变全局错误语义。","startedSeq":8539,"endedSeq":8598,"startedAt":"1788566736Z","endedAt":"1788566737Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":6977,"revision":8598,"observedAt":"1788566737Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788566737Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788566737,"revision":8598,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0b4cfb4bc1318cfc016a9b5ccb563887d0833cc95b91e6f1b9","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-8599","seq":8599,"timestamp":"1788566737Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":8599,"endedSeq":8623,"startedAt":"1788566737Z","endedAt":"1788566786Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":8599,"activityEndSeq":8623,"totalEventCount":3,"toolCallCount":2,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":1,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0582c23561da7833016a9b5ce8218087d098659d0ad758af1a","seq":8791,"timestamp":"1788566786Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"现有迁移验证通过，但 HCP 恢复契约暴露出一个协议层缺口：`SnapshotChunk` 未携带该快照覆盖到的 durable `baseEventSeq`。Client 收到快照后无法更新确认水位，断线重连会反复请求同一快照；这会直接破坏 Stage 4 的 crash/restart recovery。修复必须落在 `.proto` 真源而不是前端猜测：为 snapshot 增加 `base_event_seq`，服务端填充，客户端在完整 chunk + SHA-256 校验后原子更新投影和 durable 水位；同时让每次 transient 订阅获得新 `streamEpoch`。这是现有验收目标所必需的协议修复，不扩展业务范围。","startedSeq":8624,"endedSeq":8791,"startedAt":"1788566786Z","endedAt":"1788566789Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":7029,"revision":8791,"observedAt":"1788566789Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788566789Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788566789,"revision":8791,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0582c23561da7833016a9b5ce8218087d098659d0ad758af1a","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-8793","seq":8793,"timestamp":"1788566789Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":8793,"endedSeq":8904,"startedAt":"1788566789Z","endedAt":"1788566933Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":8793,"activityEndSeq":8904,"totalEventCount":15,"toolCallCount":12,"thoughtCount":3,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":6,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_05e3a30c22efc299016a9b5d86b22887d09ae1cab6dd3d3c6f","seq":9082,"timestamp":"1788566933Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"二进制路径已转绿，但在进入其他 Stage 4 UI 前先补齐同一恢复链的两个边界，否则现有“通过”仍会在长 Session 上失败：\n\n- 当前 snapshot 被塞进单个 ≤1 MiB Envelope；长 transcript 会违反 HCP 上限。\n- Client 尚未校验 `total_sha256`，与批准的“所有 chunk 完整且总 hash 正确后原子替换”不一致。\n- Server 尚未要求 hello 成功后再接受 replay/command。\n\n我会将 snapshot 按固定 payload 上限分块，Client 按 revision 组装、校验 chunk 元数据和 SHA-256 后一次性 restore，并在 transport 层锁定握手状态。省略任一项都会使 Stage 4 的长会话/崩溃恢复验收不成立。","startedSeq":8905,"endedSeq":9082,"startedAt":"1788566933Z","endedAt":"1788566936Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":7176,"revision":9082,"observedAt":"1788566936Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788566936Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788566936,"revision":9082,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_05e3a30c22efc299016a9b5d86b22887d09ae1cab6dd3d3c6f","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-9083","seq":9083,"timestamp":"1788566936Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":9083,"endedSeq":9214,"startedAt":"1788566936Z","endedAt":"1788567103Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":9083,"activityEndSeq":9214,"totalEventCount":17,"toolCallCount":15,"thoughtCount":2,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":2,"writtenFileCount":4,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0d0e1674a28f3ca6016a9b5e31815887d081a1c55d74cecc04","seq":9317,"timestamp":"1788567103Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"HCP 分块、hash 校验、durable 水位与 Host/Core/Web 回归均已通过。接下来先做一次当前改动边界审计，再继续剩余 Stage 4；重点检查生成文件与锁文件是否只有协议/依赖所需变化，并确认 WebSocket 生命周期没有留下忙等、握手竞态或远程隧道不可达问题。此审计只针对本轮可归因改动，不扩展到无关历史问题。","startedSeq":9215,"endedSeq":9317,"startedAt":"1788567103Z","endedAt":"1788567104Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":7344,"revision":9317,"observedAt":"1788567104Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788567104Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788567104,"revision":9317,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0d0e1674a28f3ca6016a9b5e31815887d081a1c55d74cecc04","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-9319","seq":9319,"timestamp":"1788567110Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":9319,"endedSeq":9338,"startedAt":"1788567110Z","endedAt":"1788567125Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":9319,"activityEndSeq":9338,"totalEventCount":5,"toolCallCount":4,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0b294adc88e052f2016a9b5e49e01487d0a3276be30213d881","seq":9491,"timestamp":"1788567125Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"审计确认生成变化与协议新增一致；多数 lockfile 变化是早先 `--write-locks` 的全项目解析，需要在最终 diff 中去除无关 churn。当前有一项会阻断明确的 SSH 验收：REST 与 HCP 使用两个远端端口，但安装器只隧道一个固定端口，远程浏览器拿到的 HCP locator 不可达。最小修复是把两端口都变成显式配置（本地默认可用 ephemeral；持久 Host 使用固定 REST/HCP 端口），SSH 同时建立两个 loopback forward；不改为公网绑定，也不引入 Relay。先修此部署边界及相应测试。","startedSeq":9339,"endedSeq":9491,"startedAt":"1788567125Z","endedAt":"1788567127Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":7367,"revision":9491,"observedAt":"1788567127Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788567127Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788567127,"revision":9491,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0b294adc88e052f2016a9b5e49e01487d0a3276be30213d881","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-9492","seq":9492,"timestamp":"1788567134Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":9492,"endedSeq":9714,"startedAt":"1788567134Z","endedAt":"1788567370Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":9492,"activityEndSeq":9714,"totalEventCount":32,"toolCallCount":28,"thoughtCount":4,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":6,"writtenFileCount":6,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0d3d81d95205940c016a9b5f40fad487d0818072d972f7551a","seq":9891,"timestamp":"1788567370Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"双端口与 SSH `scp -P` 回归已通过。这里还需明确一个部署约束：远程 tunnel 的本地 REST/HCP 端口必须与 Host 返回的 locator 一致；当前 installer 尚无实际 CLI 编排，后续会在该入口统一分配并映射两个端口，不能只留下一个可构造但不可执行的命令对象。\n\n先同步本轮已经落地的设计和开发计划：HCP-only 实时入口、握手门禁、分块/hash/baseEventSeq、每连接有界队列、固定远程 REST/HCP loopback 端口。然后处理下一组会直接阻断 Stage 4 的 Remote/Standalone 交付：签名验证接线、可重试安装状态、实际 CLI、固定 Java 21 runtime bundle。","startedSeq":9715,"endedSeq":9891,"startedAt":"1788567370Z","endedAt":"1788567373Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":7613,"revision":9891,"observedAt":"1788567373Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788567373Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788567373,"revision":9891,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0d3d81d95205940c016a9b5f40fad487d0818072d972f7551a","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-9893","seq":9893,"timestamp":"1788567380Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":9893,"endedSeq":9927,"startedAt":"1788567380Z","endedAt":"1788567393Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":9893,"activityEndSeq":9927,"totalEventCount":9,"toolCallCount":8,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":8,"writtenFileCount":0,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_01cc9f05235e0b86016a9b5f572dcc87d09d4d7998c2b9d543","seq":10102,"timestamp":"1788567393Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"文档当前已声明这些协议与分发不变量，但 Stage 4 开发状态还未记录实现进度；我会在功能稳定后一次性更新状态，避免把中间实现写成既成事实。\n\nRemote bootstrap 目前是明显脚手架：CLI 只打印帮助，`BundleVerifier` 未进入安装路径，操作状态不能真正重试，上传只验 archive hash，且进程输出读取可能死锁。这些都直接对应退出条件。修复顺序是：先让 installer 接受“已在本地验签”的 verified bundle 类型，并上传/远端核验规范 manifest；再定义 reservation 状态和幂等 retry；最后接 CLI 参数与 tunnel 子进程生命周期。Java runtime 打包独立处理，不把信任边界混进 shell 字符串。","startedSeq":9928,"endedSeq":10102,"startedAt":"1788567393Z","endedAt":"1788567395Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":7635,"revision":10102,"observedAt":"1788567395Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788567395Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788567395,"revision":10102,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_01cc9f05235e0b86016a9b5f572dcc87d09d4d7998c2b9d543","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-10105","seq":10105,"timestamp":"1788567403Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":10105,"endedSeq":10302,"startedAt":"1788567403Z","endedAt":"1788567653Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":10105,"activityEndSeq":10302,"totalEventCount":29,"toolCallCount":23,"thoughtCount":6,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":4,"writtenFileCount":4,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_075fe72731ffb735016a9b604997b087d0a49ce7bc300dc8d4","seq":10475,"timestamp":"1788567654Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"本地验签类型已接线并通过单测；只有 `BundleVerifier.verify(...)` 能构造 `VerifiedBundle`，installer 不再接受未验证的 manifest/archive 组合。远端再校验规范 manifest 的 SHA-256 与 archive 的已签名 hash，保证上传内容与本地验签对象一致且不依赖远端 Java/openssl。\n\n继续补中断重试不变量：操作目录显式返回 `new/resume/complete`；`complete` 直接幂等返回，`resume` 重传并从持久阶段继续；首次切换前只记录一次旧 target，避免“已切换但未写 complete”的重试覆盖回滚指针。首次安装健康失败则移除不可用 current 并停止用户服务，有旧版本则原子切回。","startedSeq":10303,"endedSeq":10475,"startedAt":"1788567654Z","endedAt":"1788567656Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":7896,"revision":10475,"observedAt":"1788567656Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788567656Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788567656,"revision":10475,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_075fe72731ffb735016a9b604997b087d0a49ce7bc300dc8d4","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-10476","seq":10476,"timestamp":"1788567657Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":10476,"endedSeq":10633,"startedAt":"1788567657Z","endedAt":"1788567865Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":10476,"activityEndSeq":10633,"totalEventCount":21,"toolCallCount":18,"thoughtCount":3,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":1,"writtenFileCount":3,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0ac8297af755f078016a9b6123b1a487d0a89f97d01e7ed5d9","seq":10788,"timestamp":"1788567865Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"Remote retry状态与无旧版本回滚现在已通过 faux process 合同，且修复了 `SystemProcessRunner` 在等待子进程退出前不排空 stdout/stderr 的死锁风险。下一步接实际 `ji-remote install/tunnel` CLI：严格参数解析、JSON manifest、Ed25519 公钥文件、本地验签后才调用 installer；SSH 私钥仅以外部路径传递。`install` 将返回版本/远端目录的非敏感 JSON，`tunnel` 执行双端口长连接并继承终端，不把命令伪装成已建立 tunnel。普通测试继续使用临时密钥与 recording runner，不读 `.env` 或真实 SSH key。","startedSeq":10634,"endedSeq":10788,"startedAt":"1788567865Z","endedAt":"1788567867Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":8107,"revision":10788,"observedAt":"1788567867Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788567867Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788567867,"revision":10788,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0ac8297af755f078016a9b6123b1a487d0a89f97d01e7ed5d9","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-10790","seq":10790,"timestamp":"1788567868Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":10790,"endedSeq":10848,"startedAt":"1788567868Z","endedAt":"1788567975Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":10790,"activityEndSeq":10848,"totalEventCount":8,"toolCallCount":7,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":5,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_03f6430221030a56016a9b61a3077c87d0aee2c590d5f4bc33","seq":10994,"timestamp":"1788567975Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"Remote CLI 的本地验签→平台探测→可重试安装，以及双端口 attached tunnel 已通过 6 个离线/faux 测试；没有读取真实 key 或 `.env`。下一步完成零前置条件 bundle：使用当前固定 Java 21 toolchain 的完整 runtime（设计明确允许首版先打包完整 runtime，不强制 jlink），把 `installDist` 与 runtime 一起组装为按 OS/CPU 的私有 tar/zip，并验证解包后 PATH 不含系统 Java、Node 